This product includes software developed by Vadym Chernets, as part of Poly A1.

No third-party code is included. routecall writes configuration files for programs it does not ship:
LiteLLM (MIT outside its enterprise/ folder, github.com/BerriAI/litellm), llama-swap (MIT,
github.com/mostlygeek/llama-swap), llama.cpp (MIT), Ollama (MIT), Presidio (MIT) as a LiteLLM guardrail.
Reading a key from the system keychain follows the pattern of mailcall (Poly A1, Apache-2.0).

